<mxfile host="app.diagrams.net"><diagram id="p_08_full_sm_low_issue" name="08-full-sm-low-issue"><mxGraphModel dx="800" dy="600" grid="0" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="1440" pageHeight="758" math="0" shadow="0"><root><mxCell id="0" /><mxCell id="1" parent="0" /><mxCell id="title" value="A low SM issue rate is not free room: about half the kernel time already fills an SM on some resource, and multi-wave kernels would be expected to gain from more SMs (illustrative, theoretical)" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;verticalAlign=middle;align=left;fontSize=20;spacing=6;fontStyle=1;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#000000;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="12" width="1400" height="60" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="smp" value="" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;verticalAlign=top;align=left;fontSize=11;spacing=6;fillColor=none;strokeColor=#888888;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#000000;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="84" width="500" height="436" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="smh" value="&lt;b&gt;Two different questions about the GPU and one SM&lt;/b&gt; (schematic gauges; per-SM limits of an Orin-class board)" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;verticalAlign=top;align=left;fontSize=12;spacing=6;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#000000;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="30" y="90" width="480" height="36" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="q1" value="&lt;b&gt;Q1. How often do the SMs issue an instruction?&lt;/b&gt; (full stack)" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;verticalAlign=top;align=left;fontSize=11;spacing=6;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#000000;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="30" y="132" width="480" height="18" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="issn" value="SM issue rate" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;verticalAlign=middle;align=right;fontSize=10;spacing=6;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#000000;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="30" y="152" width="152" height="36" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="issbg" value="" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;verticalAlign=middle;align=center;fontSize=10;spacing=6;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#888888;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#000000;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="190" y="156" width="300" height="28" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="issd" value="" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;verticalAlign=middle;align=center;fontSize=10;spacing=6;dashed=1;dashPattern=4 3;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#000000;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="190" y="156" width="180.0" height="28" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="isss" value="" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;verticalAlign=middle;align=center;fontSize=10;spacing=6;fillColor=#9fc0e8;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#000000;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="190" y="156" width="60.0" height="28" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="issl" value="solid: 0.2 of peak [sm_issue_full_stack, illustrative]; dashed: GPU has work 0.6 of the time [gpu_active_full_stack, illustrative]" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;verticalAlign=top;align=left;fontSize=9;spacing=6;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#000000;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="190" y="186" width="320" height="28" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="q2" value="&lt;b&gt;Q2. While a big GEMM kernel runs, how full is its SM?&lt;/b&gt;" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;verticalAlign=top;align=left;fontSize=11;spacing=6;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#000000;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="30" y="222" width="480" height="18" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="wpn" value="warps&lt;br/&gt;(48 per SM [max_warps_per_sm])" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;verticalAlign=middle;align=right;fontSize=10;spacing=6;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#000000;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="30" y="242" width="152" height="36" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="wpbg" value="" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;verticalAlign=middle;align=center;fontSize=10;spacing=6;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#888888;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#000000;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="190" y="246" width="300" height="28" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="wpd" value="" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;verticalAlign=middle;align=center;fontSize=10;spacing=6;dashed=1;dashPattern=4 3;fillColor=#e9f4e6;strokeColor=#3f7f33;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#000000;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="190" y="246" width="90.0" height="28" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="wps" value="" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;verticalAlign=middle;align=center;fontSize=10;spacing=6;fillColor=#b9dfb0;strokeColor=#3f7f33;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#000000;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="190" y="246" width="30.0" height="28" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="wpl" value="warp-slot fill 0.1–0.3 [gemm_warp_slot_fill, illustrative]: looks mostly empty" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;verticalAlign=top;align=left;fontSize=9;spacing=6;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#000000;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="190" y="276" width="320" height="28" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="bkn" value="blocks&lt;br/&gt;(16 per SM [max_blocks_per_sm_cc87])" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;verticalAlign=middle;align=right;fontSize=10;spacing=6;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#000000;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="30" y="302" width="152" height="36" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="bkbg" value="" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;verticalAlign=middle;align=center;fontSize=10;spacing=6;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#888888;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#000000;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="190" y="306" width="300" height="28" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="bkl" value="not given per kernel in this kit" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;verticalAlign=top;align=left;fontSize=9;spacing=6;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#000000;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="190" y="336" width="320" height="28" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="rgn" value="registers&lt;br/&gt;(65 536 per SM [registers_per_sm])" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;verticalAlign=middle;align=right;fontSize=10;spacing=6;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#000000;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="30" y="362" width="152" height="36" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="rgbg" value="" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;verticalAlign=middle;align=center;fontSize=10;spacing=6;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#888888;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#000000;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="190" y="366" width="300" height="28" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="rgs" value="" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;verticalAlign=middle;align=center;fontSize=10;spacing=6;fillColor=#b9dfb0;strokeColor=#3f7f33;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#000000;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="190" y="366" width="270.0" height="28" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="rgl" value="register-bound: at or past the &quot;full&quot; line (schematic)" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;verticalAlign=top;align=left;fontSize=9;spacing=6;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#000000;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="190" y="396" width="320" height="28" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="smn" value="shared memory&lt;br/&gt;(max 164 KB per SM [l1_shared_per_sm_orin_kb])" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;verticalAlign=middle;align=right;fontSize=10;spacing=6;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#000000;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="30" y="422" width="152" height="36" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="smbg" value="" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;verticalAlign=middle;align=center;fontSize=10;spacing=6;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#888888;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#000000;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="190" y="426" width="300" height="28" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="sms" value="" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;verticalAlign=middle;align=center;fontSize=10;spacing=6;dashed=1;dashPattern=2 2;fillColor=#b9dfb0;strokeColor=#3f7f33;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#000000;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="190" y="426" width="270.0" height="28" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="sml" value="or shared-memory-bound instead (schematic, dotted)" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;verticalAlign=top;align=left;fontSize=9;spacing=6;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#000000;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="190" y="456" width="320" height="28" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="thl" value="dashed vertical: &quot;full&quot; = binding fill &amp;gt;= 90 % [kernel_time_sms_full_share, illustrative]" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;verticalAlign=top;align=right;fontSize=9;spacing=6;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#000000;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="250.0" y="484" width="230" height="30" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="ana" value="Analogy: a car park full of a few wide vans." style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;verticalAlign=top;align=left;fontSize=9;spacing=6;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#555555;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="30" y="482" width="150" height="34" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="tp" value="" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;verticalAlign=top;align=left;fontSize=11;spacing=6;fillColor=none;strokeColor=#888888;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#000000;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="535" y="84" width="885" height="178" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="th" value="&lt;b&gt;Fractions from solo traces&lt;/b&gt; (from launch configurations: theoretical; illustrative)" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;verticalAlign=top;align=left;fontSize=12;spacing=6;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#000000;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="545" y="90" width="865" height="20" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="tk0" value="0" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;verticalAlign=top;align=center;fontSize=9;spacing=6;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#000000;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="810" y="238" width="30" height="14" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="tk0.5" value="0.5" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;verticalAlign=top;align=center;fontSize=9;spacing=6;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#000000;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1050.0" y="238" width="30" height="14" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="tk1" value="1" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;verticalAlign=top;align=center;fontSize=9;spacing=6;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#000000;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1290" y="238" width="30" height="14" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="rn0" value="&lt;b&gt;SMs &amp;gt;= 90 % full on some resource&lt;/b&gt;" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;verticalAlign=middle;align=right;fontSize=10;spacing=6;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#000000;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="543" y="122" width="276" height="26" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="rv0" value="" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;verticalAlign=middle;align=center;fontSize=10;spacing=6;fillColor=#b9dfb0;strokeColor=#3f7f33;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#000000;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="825" y="124" width="240.0" height="22" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="rt0" value="about 0.5 [kernel_time_sms_full_share]" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;verticalAlign=top;align=left;fontSize=9;spacing=6;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#000000;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1071.0" y="127" width="200" height="16" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="rn1" value="&lt;b&gt;warp-slot fill of the large GEMM kernels (fraction of slots, not of time)&lt;/b&gt;" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;verticalAlign=middle;align=right;fontSize=10;spacing=6;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#000000;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="543" y="160" width="276" height="26" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="rl1" value="" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;verticalAlign=middle;align=center;fontSize=10;spacing=6;dashed=1;dashPattern=2 2;fillColor=#f6f6f6;strokeColor=#888888;strokeWidth=1;fontColor=#000000;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="825" y="162" width="48.0" height="22" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="rv1" value="" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;verticalAlign=middle;align=center;fontSize=10;spacing=6;dashed=1;dashPattern=4 3;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#3f7f33;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#000000;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="873.0" y="162" width="96.0" height="22" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="rt1" value="0.1–0.3 [gemm_warp_slot_fill]" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;verticalAlign=top;align=left;fontSize=9;spacing=6;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#000000;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="975.0" y="165" width="200" height="16" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="rn2" value="&lt;b&gt;kernel time in &amp;gt; 1 wave, per service&lt;/b&gt;" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;verticalAlign=middle;align=right;fontSize=10;spacing=6;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#000000;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="543" y="198" width="276" height="26" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="rl2" value="" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;verticalAlign=middle;align=center;fontSize=10;spacing=6;dashed=1;dashPattern=2 2;fillColor=#f6f6f6;strokeColor=#888888;strokeWidth=1;fontColor=#000000;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="825" y="200" width="168.0" height="22" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="rv2" value="" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;verticalAlign=middle;align=center;fontSize=10;spacing=6;fillColor=#9fc0e8;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#000000;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="993.0" y="200" width="168.0" height="22" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="rt2" value="0.35–0.7 [multiwave_share, illustrative]" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;verticalAlign=top;align=left;fontSize=9;spacing=6;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#000000;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1167.0" y="203" width="200" height="16" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="reg" value="&lt;b&gt;Why a GEMM fills an SM with few warps (worked register limit).&lt;/b&gt; To fill all 48 warp slots a kernel may use at most about 40 registers per thread: 65 536 ÷ 48 = 1365.3 per warp, rounded down to a multiple of 256 = 1280, ÷ 32 threads = 40 (my estimate from `registers_per_sm`, `max_warps_per_sm`, `warp_size` and `register_alloc_unit_per_warp`). A GEMM kernel often uses far more, up to 255 per thread [max_registers_per_thread], so its SM is full by registers with only a few warps resident." style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;verticalAlign=top;align=left;fontSize=10;spacing=6;fillColor=#f7f7f7;strokeColor=#bbbbbb;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#000000;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="535" y="272" width="885" height="86" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="wp2" value="" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;verticalAlign=top;align=left;fontSize=11;spacing=6;fillColor=none;strokeColor=#888888;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#000000;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="535" y="368" width="885" height="152" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="wh" value="&lt;b&gt;Waves&lt;/b&gt; (schematic): waves = ⌈blocks ÷ (SMs × blocks per SM)⌉. Below, one block per SM for clarity: a kernel with blocks for two full rounds and a partial third on the 16 SMs [sm_count_orin]." style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;verticalAlign=top;align=left;fontSize=10;spacing=6;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#000000;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="545" y="372" width="865" height="34" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="w0_0" value="" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;verticalAlign=middle;align=center;fontSize=10;spacing=6;fillColor=#9fc0e8;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;strokeWidth=1;fontColor=#000000;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="555" y="416" width="14" height="14" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="w0_1" value="" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;verticalAlign=middle;align=center;fontSize=10;spacing=6;fillColor=#9fc0e8;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;strokeWidth=1;fontColor=#000000;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="571" y="416" width="14" height="14" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="w0_2" value="" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;verticalAlign=middle;align=center;fontSize=10;spacing=6;fillColor=#9fc0e8;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;strokeWidth=1;fontColor=#000000;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="587" y="416" width="14" height="14" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="w0_3" value="" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;verticalAlign=middle;align=center;fontSize=10;spacing=6;fillColor=#9fc0e8;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;strokeWidth=1;fontColor=#000000;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="603" y="416" width="14" height="14" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="w0_4" value="" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;verticalAlign=middle;align=center;fontSize=10;spacing=6;fillColor=#9fc0e8;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;strokeWidth=1;fontColor=#000000;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="619" y="416" width="14" height="14" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="w0_5" value="" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;verticalAlign=midd